  "description": "In-Ui, a longtime fan of actor Yeong-Min. Inspired by Yeong-min, he begins to dream of becoming an actor himself, and is accepted into the university where he serves as an adjunct professor. As In-Ui begins to spend dreamlike days with Yeong-Min, he gradually develops romantic feelings for him and wants to get closer to him on a personal level. However, Yeong-Min already has a close colleague named Ji-Seop by his side, and torn between jealousy toward Ji-Seop and his longing for Yeong-Min, In-Ui finds himself growing increasingly tormented...\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
